Kiawe mostly specializes in Pokémon. All of his Pokémon can use Z-Moves and are capable battlers, even able to overcome type disadvantages. Like , Kiawe doesn't have a full party by the end of the series. Kiawe often uses his first Pokémon and Ride Pokémon to help him make deliveries for his family's farm. Kiawe is also one of the most experienced Trainers in 's class, due to being the first to have a Z-Ring and being able to use Z-Moves prior to the series.

